  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Media advocacy to mainstream agenda on women inclusion and participation in governance and electoral process</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project seeks to mainstream gender in the constitution and in electoral laws, and address underrepresentation of women, including young women and women with disabilities in elective and appointive positions through a coordinated media advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
